{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"詩篇","commonName":"詩篇","title":"詩篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"fcaa20905e646fef52638ee11406d121669ccd5d9c1cdf8154b5f6c31cc2988f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2452},"chapter":{"number":76,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["上帝是勝利者"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["亞薩的詩歌，交與伶長。用絲弦的樂器。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"在猶大，上帝為人所認識；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在以色列，他的名為大。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在撒冷有他的帳幕；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在錫安有他的居所。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他在那裏折斷弓上的火箭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並盾牌、刀劍，和爭戰的兵器。（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"你從有野食之山而來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有光華和榮美。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心中勇敢的人都被搶奪；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們睡了長覺，沒有一個英雄能措手。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各的上帝啊，你的斥責一發，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"坐車的、騎馬的都沉睡了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"惟獨你是可畏的！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你怒氣一發，誰能在你面前站得住呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你從天上使人聽判斷。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝起來施行審判，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要救地上一切謙卑的人；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時地就懼怕而靜默。（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"人的忿怒要成全你的榮美；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人的餘怒，你要禁止。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們許願，當向耶和華－你們的上帝還願；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在他四面的人都當拿貢物獻給那可畏的主。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他要挫折王子的驕氣；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他向地上的君王顯威可畏。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/76.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/77.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/75.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}